## Lessons

- Merging by subject line alone ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)) groups different causes together when symptoms sound alike (`parser` and `hint`, plus `oneDayMove`).
- `meta.intakeTag` guesses from `browserLocale` (`parser ×356 · hint ×23` on the 379 `parser` reports; `hint ×18 · parser ×15` on the 33 `hint` reports); the real cause depends on tenant locale, channel, and booking form.

